OL,3,GNEWSA#2m fake weight-loss pens found in
OL,4,A'filthy' hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 12,000 counterfeit
OL,7,Fweight-loss pens, worth an estimated
OL,8,F#2m, have been seized in a raid on an
OL,9,Findustrial unit.
OL,11,FThe fake goods were found at a "filthy
OL,12,Fwarehouse" on an estate in Birmingham,
OL,13,Faccording to the Medicines and
OL,14,FHealthcare Products Regulatory Agency
OL,15,F(MHRA).
OL,17,F"There is no guarantee of what they
OL,18,Fcontain or whether they have been
OL,19,Fcontaminated with harmful substances,"
OL,20,Fsaid the agency..
